 {crash}←SaveErrorWorkspace(filename parms crash);wsid;lx;qdmx
 :If parms.saveErrorWS
     wsid←⎕WSID
     ⎕WSID←filename
     lx←⎕LX
     ⎕LX←'⎕TRAP←0 ''S'' ⍝',⎕LX
     :Trap parms.trapInternalErrors/0
         ⎕SAVE ⎕WSID
     :Else
         qdmx←⎕DMX
         crash.SaveFailed←qdmx.Message
     :EndTrap
     ⎕WSID←wsid       ⍝ Potentially important (for example when running test cases)
     ⎕LX←lx
 :EndIf
